id-at-mozillaNickname OBJECT IDENTIFIER ::= { 1 3 6 1 4 1 13769 2 1 }
id-at-mozillaSecondEmail OBJECT IDENTIFIER ::= { 1 3 6 1 4 1 13769 2 2 }
id-at-mozillaUseHtmlMail OBJECT IDENTIFIER ::= { 1 3 6 1 4 1 13769 2 3 }
